&lt;p&gt;US Tier 1: San Francisco Bay Area and New York City&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;US Tier 2: All California excluding San Francisco Bay Area,&amp;nbsp;Seattle Metro,&amp;nbsp;Boston Metro,&amp;nbsp;Chicago Metro,&amp;nbsp;Denver Metro, Austin Metro,&amp;nbsp;Portland Metro&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;US Tier 3: All other cities and states&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Pay Zones&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;US Tier 1: $260,000 - $357,500&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;US Tier 2: $221,000 - $303,875&lt;/p&gt;
